---- MODULE MCEcho ----
EXTENDS Echo

\*--------------------------------------------------------------
\* Constants (to be instantiated by the configuration file)
\*--------------------------------------------------------------
CONSTANT Node, initiator, R, NoNode

\*--------------------------------------------------------------
\* Concrete definitions used by the .cfg via substitution
\*--------------------------------------------------------------
N1 == {"n1", "n2", "n3"}

I1 == "n1"

R1 == {
        << "n1", "n2" >>,
        << "n2", "n1" >>,
        << "n1", "n3" >>,
        << "n3", "n1" >>,
        << "n2", "n3" >>,
        << "n3", "n2" >>
      }

\*--------------------------------------------------------------
\* Specification to be checked
\*--------------------------------------------------------------
TestSpec == Spec

